'''Slowpoke''' (Japanese: '''ヤドン''' ''Yadon'') is a {{ct|Water}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Shine}} expansion.

