==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Scarlet & Violet|Slowpoke|42}} from the {{TCG|Scarlet & Violet}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Slowpoke}}.
*{{m|Headbutt}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Slowpoke}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

